      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990-EZ, Part III, Line 28</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>Bread Salt Gallery is a community arts organization. Through our quarterly exhibitions and artist in residency programs, and our artist mentoring, we provide both a voice and a springboard for emergent and established artists across disciplines. Guided by a sense of experimentation founded in action and rigor, Bread Salt Gallery seeks to become a regional leader in the arts, with a commitment towards fostering growth for bi-national artists, craftspeople and the artisan co-hort. We engage in programs across artistic disciplines that make our region stronger and more cohesive. We work to establish a presence in the larger art world.</ExplanationTxt>
